WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.136 --> 00:00:07.536
Yes, more and more fathers, the groom's or bride's father, are coming along these days.

2
00:00:07.872 --> 00:00:15.960
As a host of the wedding standing in front of the guests, he too wants a neat, polished image with the artist's advice.

3
00:00:16.296 --> 00:00:22.200
In the pre-consultation, he can get recommendations for a suit color and tie color that bring out his best complexion,

4
00:00:22.536 --> 00:00:28.632
which creates a visual harmony that elevates both families' presence when the parents stand side by side on the day.

5
00:00:28.968 --> 00:00:34.056
For fathers concerned about thinning hair, hair-covering techniques for the day can also be discussed in advance,

6
00:00:34.392 --> 00:00:40.848
and practicing a natural smile and greeting posture gives fathers a real boost of confidence too.

7
00:00:41.184 --> 00:00:45.240
That said, if he can't come along, the mother can pass along the details on his behalf.
